<% const data=learning(); %>
<div class="page-wrap home-wrap">
<div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> OPENFOAM LEARNING LAB</div>
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="pill">面向初学者 · OpenCFD v2512</div><h1>OpenFOAM v2512<br><em>数值模拟基础与应用</em></h1><p>课程覆盖环境配置、网格生成、数值方法与结果验证，<br>并以电极气泡生长与脱落为应用专题。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/start/">开始学习 <%- icon('arrow') %></a><a class="text-link" href="/courses/">浏览 28 讲课程 ↗</a></div><div class="hero-foot"><span>包含 Linux 与算例操作基础</span><span>中文讲义与命令示例</span></div></div>
<figure class="hero-visual official-cover"><div class="official-brand"><img src="/assets/official/openfoam-logo.png" width="240" height="59" alt="OpenFOAM 官方标识"><span>THE OPEN SOURCE CFD TOOLBOX</span></div><img class="official-banner" src="/assets/official/openfoam-banner.jpg" width="1920" height="500" alt="OpenFOAM 官方网站展示的汽车外流场可视化图"><figcaption>官方应用展示 · 图片来源：<a href="https://www.openfoam.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenCFD / OpenFOAM ↗</a></figcaption></figure></section>
<div class="stat-strip"><div><strong>28<span>讲</span></strong><p>课程单元与配套练习</p></div><div><strong>7<span>阶段</span></strong><p>分阶段学习与验证</p></div><div><strong><%= data.commands.length %><span>条</span></strong><p>可检索的命令参考</p></div><div><strong>v2512</strong><p>OpenCFD 发行分支</p></div></div>
<section class="dashboard-row"><div class="continue-panel"><div class="section-kicker">LEARNING PROGRESS</div><h2 id="continue-title">推荐起点：环境配置与方腔算例</h2><p id="continue-description">检查软件版本与运行环境，完成网格生成、求解和后处理。</p><div class="continue-bottom"><a href="/lessons/01/" class="button secondary" id="continue-link">进入第 01 讲 <%- icon('arrow') %></a><span class="progress-caption"><span id="progress-count">0</span> / 28 讲已完成 <small>本机学习记录</small></span></div><div class="progress-track"><span id="progress-bar"></span></div></div><a class="quick-reference" href="/commands/"><span class="mini-icon"><%- icon('terminal') %></span><div><h2>命令与选项查询</h2><p>按系统工具、前处理、求解与后处理分类，<br>查询功能、参数和使用示例。</p></div><div class="code-preview"><span>$</span> checkMesh -allGeometry</div><span class="text-link">打开命令速查 <%- icon('arrow') %></span></a></section>
<section><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">COURSE STRUCTURE</div><h2>课程阶段与学习内容</h2></div><a href="/courses/" class="text-link">查看完整学习路径 <%- icon('arrow') %></a></div><div class="stage-grid"><% data.stages.slice(0,4).forEach((stage,i)=>{ %><a class="stage-card" href="/courses/#stage-<%= stage.id %>"><div class="stage-top"><span class="stage-number">0<%= stage.id %></span><span class="stage-range">第 <%= stage.range %> 讲</span></div><div class="stage-art art-<%= i %>"><%- partial('_partial/stage-art',{kind:i}) %></div><h3><%= stage.name %></h3><p><%= stage.description %></p><span class="stage-link">进入学习 <%- icon('arrow') %></span></a><% }); %></div></section>
<section class="bottom-grid"><a class="feature-row" href="/assignments/"><span class="mini-icon"><%- icon('task') %></span><div><h3>课程作业与结果验证</h3><p>查看作业要求，提交算例与分析。</p></div><%- icon('arrow') %></a><a class="feature-row" href="/community/"><span class="mini-icon lavender"><%- icon('chat') %></span><div><h3>技术问题与复现分析</h3><p>提供版本、日志与配置，讨论问题原因。</p></div><%- icon('arrow') %></a></section>
</div>
